{"seq":65,"data":{"type":"RUN_FINISHED","threadId":"28036c63-5155-45cf-80f4-bf66ddf508db","runId":"run_1_1788373938941","result":"Created `/app/filter.py`. The script removes XSS vulnerabilities from HTML files while preserving structure and formatting:\n\n**Key features:**\n- Removes `<script>` tags and their content entirely\n- Removes event handler attributes (`onclick`, `onload`, `onmouseover`, etc.)\n- Neutralizes `javascript:` URLs in `href`, `src`, and `action` attributes by replacing them with empty values\n- Preserves all formatting, whitespace, tables, headers, and non-dangerous HTML attributes\n- Uses regex patterns for surgical removal of only dangerous code\n- Modifies the file in-place\n\n**Usage:**\n```bash\npython filter.py <html_file>\n```\n\nThe script reads the HTML file, removes all JavaScript and XSS attack vectors, and writes the cleaned version back to the same file.","rawEvent":{"duration_api_ms":34311,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"28036c63-5155-45cf-80f4-bf66ddf508db","total_cost_usd":0.03810615,"usage":{"input_tokens":17,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5891,"cache_read_input_tokens":26194,"output_tokens":5399,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":4472},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5891},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":8,"output_tokens":383,"cache_read_input_tokens":13505,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5075,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5075,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":1031,"outputTokens":16,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.001111,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"thinkingTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-haiku-4-5":{"in